<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE JULY LOSS WIDENS TO PLN 1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE JULY LOSS WIDENS TO PLN 1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.03 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.01 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.88 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Sales		    6.25 vs  12.57</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 7.18 vs   6.82</p>
